      "explanation_html": "<div class=\"question q-prose\"><!-- HTML_TAG_START --><p> $\\begin{aligned} &amp; \\text{We have,} \\\\ &amp; \\begin{aligned} &amp; \\frac{x^{2}}{36}+\\frac{y^{2}}{16}=1 \\\\ \\Rightarrow &amp; \\frac{x^{2}}{6^{2}}+\\frac{y^{2}}{4^{2}}=1 \\end{aligned} \\end{aligned}$ </p>\n<p> $\\begin{aligned} &amp; \\therefore a=6\\text{and}b=4 \\\\ &amp; \\text{Since,}a&gt;b \\end{aligned}$ </p>\n<p><p> $\\therefore e=\\sqrt{1-\\frac{b^{2}}{a^{2}}}$ $</p>  $\\begin{aligned} &amp; =\\sqrt{1-\\frac{(4)^{2}}{(6)^{2}}} \\\\ &amp; =\\sqrt{1-\\frac{16}{36}} \\\\ &amp; =\\sqrt{\\frac{20}{36}} \\\\ &amp; =\\frac{2\\sqrt{5}}{6} \\end{aligned}$ </p><!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div>",
